WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.344 --> 00:00:02.100
Do Catholics worship Mary?

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.302
No.

3
00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:05.138
And you don't have to take my word for it,

4
00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:07.906
because the Catechism says it in writing.

5
00:00:08.356 --> 00:00:10.179
Paragraph nine seventy-one:

6
00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:15.445
devotion to Mary "differs essentially from the adoration" given to the Father,

7
00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:17.335
the Son and the Holy Spirit.

8
00:00:17.335 --> 00:00:22.601
Adoration, the kind of worship that says "you are God and I am your creature",

9
00:00:22.601 --> 00:00:24.019
belongs to God alone.

10
00:00:24.019 --> 00:00:26.719
Paragraph two thousand and ninety-seven.

11
00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:29.937
So what is the honour Catholics give her?

12
00:00:29.937 --> 00:00:32.908
It's the honour Scripture already gives her.

13
00:00:32.908 --> 00:00:36.554
An angel greets her, "Hail, full of grace." Elizabeth,

14
00:00:36.554 --> 00:00:40.537
filled with the Holy Spirit, calls her blessed among women.

15
00:00:40.537 --> 00:00:42.022
And Mary herself says,

16
00:00:42.022 --> 00:00:46.950
"all generations shall call me blessed." When Catholics call her blessed,

17
00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:49.246
we're fulfilling her own prophecy.

18
00:00:49.696 --> 00:00:53.274
Think of it like honouring your best friend's mother.

19
00:00:53.274 --> 00:00:56.042
You honour her because of who her son is.

20
00:00:56.042 --> 00:00:58.945
Every road that runs to Mary ends at Jesus.
